  "historyNote": "#6047, eff 6-3-95; ss by #6316, eff 8-13-96; amd by #6944, eff 2-24-99; ss by #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #12173, eff 5-10-17",
